Z||000014||Archie||08-15-2000||11:28 PM||||Actually, the TPI car (4th picture above) is a pretty fast Fiero. It has a new ZZ4 crate engine with TPI & LT1 injectors. However, I won't be able to personally test drive it because it has some woofer or Amp or something behind the drivers seat. That keeps the seat from being able to slide back far enough for me to get into the car. One of my MUCH SHORTER employees will have the burden of doing all the test driving. I will still have to test drive all the others though.<P>Archie<P>BTW, I'm still looking for another helper from this area (NW suburbs of Chicago). One of the requirements would be to learn your way into doing some of the test driving. If I could get more of this "test Driving" burden off my sholders then I could get more done.<P>I doesn't pay too much, but could become one of the fun jobs or your life that you tell your Grand children about.<P>Think about it, what could be more fun than building and driving (& bragging about) some of the fastest cars around and doing it all with someone elses' money.<P>Would make the right someone a nice extra job.<P>Archie||||reg||1
